<title>GERMANY: Buba revises up pan-German Apr industry output.</title>
<headline>Buba revises up pan-German Apr industry output.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the</p>
<p>following revised index figures for German industry output:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT	Apr 97	   Mar 97</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +0.3 (-1.3)    +0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +3.0 (+1.3)    +3.8</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   100.8 (99.2)   100.5</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT  Month-on-month change(pct)	 +0.4 (-1.4)    +0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +3.0 (+1.1)    +2.4</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    97.5 (95.7)    97.1</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT  Month-on-month change(pct)	 +2.4 (+2.2)    +2.4</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +2.2 (+1.7)   +11.7</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   146.6 (146.7)  143.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
